   363	- **Goal:** Port the original core UI's HTML/CSS so the rewrite looks the same, rewrite `main.js` to
   364	  drive the new handle (incl. the async scorecard), and build with `wasm-pack`.
   365	- **Requirements:** R8, R9, R2 (drop the `=10` preflight).
   366	- **Dependencies:** U3, U4.
   367	- **Files:**
   368	  - `www/index.html` (new) — port the core DOM from `git show
   369	    main:crates/sim-wasm/www-3d/index.html`: `main.layout` (sidebar + viewer), `#toggle`/`#reset`,
   370	    the **main** scene panel (`#scene-center-pour`, `#scene-free-stream` = "Water Only"),
   371	    water-velocity slider, spout pad + height, `.stats` (Particles/FPS), the **scorecard** rows
   372	    (yield/TDS/evenness/drawdown), `#sim-canvas`, `.cross-section-overlay`, `.view-cube`. **Omit**
   373	    `#scene-panel-debug`, `#debug-stats`, `#timeseries-drawer`.
   374	  - `www/styles.css` (new) — port the in-scope styles + theme tokens (`--sidebar-width`, panel/ink/
   375	    accent colors, serif font, mobile breakpoint); drop styles for omitted panels.
   376	  - `www/main.js` (new — **adapted rewrite**, not a copy) — `import init, { CoffeeSimApp } from
   377	    "./pkg/coffee_sim.js"`; `navigator.gpu` preflight; `await init()` → `CoffeeSimApp.create(canvas)`;
   378	    rAF loop (`step_frame(1/60)`, `render()`, `updateViewCube()` from yaw/pitch, `updateFps()`, and
   379	    an every-N-frames `await sampleMetrics()` updating the scorecard); wire each control (pause flag,
   380	    reset, scenes, water-velocity, spout pad/height, canvas orbit/zoom/pan, DPR-aware resize).
   381	    **Strip** v1's metrics-readback wiring, `#debug-stats`/timeseries/evaluation code, and the
   382	    `REQUIRED_STORAGE_BUFFERS_PER_SHADER_STAGE = 10` preflight (R2).
   383	  - Build: `wasm-pack build --target web --out-dir www/pkg --release` (documented; `pkg/` gitignored).
   384	- **Approach:** `index.html`/`styles.css` are near-verbatim for the look; `main.js` keeps v1's loop
   385	  + control-wiring + CSS view-cube structure but is reconstructed against the new (smaller) API and
   386	  the async scorecard. The cross-section overlay ships as the **CSS frame/label only** (the render
   387	  pass is deferred — Scope Boundaries; explicitly partial-parity there).
   388	- **Patterns to follow:** the three v1 `www-3d/` files (structure, rAF loop, `updateViewCube`,
   389	  control handlers, DPR resize), minus the stripped couplings.
   390	- **Test scenarios:**
   391	  - Covers R9. *Visual parity (manual, WebGPU browser):* sidebar+viewer layout, theme, view-cube,
   392	    cross-section frame match v1 side-by-side for the in-scope surfaces.
   393	  - Covers R8. *Controls drive the sim (manual):* pause/reset; Center Pour/Water Only switch scenes;
   394	    velocity slider changes the stream; spout pad/height move the pour; orbit/zoom/pan + view-cube
   395	    tracking work.
   396	  - Covers R6. *Scorecard (manual):* Particles + FPS update every frame; yield/TDS/evenness/drawdown
   397	    update at the sample cadence without stutter.
   398	  - Covers R2. *No 10-buffer preflight:* the ported `main.js` contains no storage-buffer-limit
   399	    preflight; the app runs against baseline limits.
   400	  - *WebGPU-absent fallback:* with `navigator.gpu` undefined, the preflight shows a message and does
   401	    not `init()`.
   402	  - Test expectation: web verification is **manual in a WebGPU browser** (no headless WebGPU in CI);
   403	    `wasm-pack build` success + the U1–U4 native unit tests cover the automatable surface.

